      "id": "gid://shopify/Product/8364700205222",
      "title": "Boho Wall Planter: A Touch of Nature, Elevated",
      "vendor": "AllThings3DShop",
      "status": "ACTIVE",
      "productType": "3D Printed Wall Decor",
      "descriptionHtml": "<p>Transform your walls into a vertical garden with these exquisite Boho Wall Planters—designed to bring a chic, nature-inspired touch to your space without the weight or fragility of traditional materials.</p>\n<p>Crafted from lightweight, durable plastic (not ceramic or clay), these planters combine sculptural design with everyday practicality. The result is a piece that’s easy to hang, easy to style, and made to elevate your walls with minimal effort.</p>\n<p>Each planter features a unique wavy frame that adds a whimsical, artistic flair. The earthy tones of terracotta, vibrant green, and bone white complement a wide range of interiors—from minimalist and modern to relaxed bohemian spaces.</p>\n<p>Perfect for artificial plants, dried florals, or lightweight greenery accents, these planters bring life and texture to your walls while maintaining a clean, low-maintenance aesthetic.</p>\n<p>⚠️ Know Before You Buy<br>•    Material: 3D printed plastic (PLA) — lightweight and durable<br>•    Plant Use: Designed for artificial or dried plants<br>•    No drainage holes<br>•    Size: 9.5” x 8” x 2.25” — see photos for scale reference</p>\n<p>🧱 Material &amp; Finish<br>•    Made from durable, eco-friendly plastic<br>•    Lightweight for easy wall mounting<br>•    Subtle layer texture from the 3D printing process adds character</p>\n<p>🔧 Easy Mounting<br>Designed for flexible installation:<br>•    Hang with a hook<br>•    Mount with a nail or screw<br>•    Use command strips for a no-drill option (not included)</p>\n<p>Bring the beauty of nature indoors with these charming Boho Wall Planters, and enjoy a touch of greenery in every corner of your home. Available now on Etsy, where artistry meets functionality.</p>",
