      "descriptionHtml": "<p>Introduce a touch of contemporary elegance to your space with The Luxar, a 3D-printed planter that combines sleek design with practical functionality. Featuring an eye-catching, spiraled structure, this planter is designed to enhance the aesthetic of any room. The Luxar is available in a variety of colors and three versatile sizes — 2\" (displayed) , 3\", and 4\" openings — perfect for showcasing your favorite plants.</p>\n<p>Key Features:</p>\n<p>Innovative 3D-Printed Design: Crafted with a distinctive spiraled pattern for a contemporary and dynamic look.</p>\n<p>Multiple Sizes: Available in 2\" (displayed) , 3\", or 4\" openings to accommodate a range of plants.</p>\n<p>Color Selection: Choose from various colors to complement your decor.</p>\n<p>Functional Drainage: Includes drainage holes to promote healthy plant growth.</p>\n<p>Matching Stand: Comes with a coordinating stand for added stability and style.</p>\n<p>Elevate your plant presentation with The Luxar. Whether you're looking to enhance your living space or office, this planter offers a perfect blend of contemporary design and practicality.</p>",
